at the library.\r\n\r\nAt the day of the entrance exam a beautifull girl appears, it is the girl from the roof. \r\nWhen the test start the girl enters the class and declares that she is Aya Tojo. \r\nManaka can't stop thinking about her and in the end of the day he realizes that he loves her.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80759/358656.jpg"},{"title":"Second Button for a Souvenir / A Childhood Friend Stirs Up a Storm","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"88507","synopsis":"After the exams everyone has passed and entered the school. \r\nIn the day of graduating Manaka meets Tsukasa that tells him she know he likes Aya and she's not going to the same school as he is.\r\nThey break up and Manaka and Aya meet at the roof again.\r\n\r\nOne morning Manaka wakes up and sees his childhood friend Yui half naked. \r\nYui tells him that she came to check out schools for next year and they go out to look.\r\nOn their way back they they see two dogs which Yui is scared of and Manaka save them from being attacked.\r\nIn the morning Yui was supposed to leave she slept too much and missed her train.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80759/358658.jpg"},{"title":"A Turbulent High School Life / Clashing Thoughts and Feelings","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"88508","synopsis":"Manaka got a video camera for his graduation and goes filming in the park. While he was filming a girl the wind came and showed her panties to him.\r\nOn the first day of school everyone is attracted to Aya and before class Manaka finds out that the girl from the park is in his class and her name is Kitaouji Satsuki.\r\nThe next day Aya comes to school differently and by accident starts a fight which in the end causes Satsuki to understand something.\r\n\r\nManaka wants to revive the film club but in order to do it he needs 5 members. He asks Komiyama and a also a guy named Sotomura appears and wants to join. And finally Satsuki offers that she will also join the club.\r\nManaka meets Aya on the roof where she tells him that she already joined a club and runs away. Satsuki come to ask what happened and while talking to Manaka she tells him that she likes him.\r\nOn his way home, Manaka meets Tsukasa.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80759/358660.jpg"},{"title":"Panic in My Room / A Tsunami of a Field Trip","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"88509","synopsis":"Manaka invites Aya to his house in order to find an idea for their film. \r\nWhile they are there Tsukasa, Satsuki, Komiyama, Yui, Sotomura and Oukusa apears and everything goes wrong.\r\n\r\nFor their summer camp the filming club goes to the beach. \r\nAt night Manaka meets Satsuki in the hallway and they talk.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80759/358662.jpg"},{"title":"The Best Present I Could Give / Wandering Feelings","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"88510","synopsis":"It is Nisino's birthday and she waits for something that will happen, what is this thing she's waiting for?\r\nIn the night she and Manaka meet.\r\n\r\nIn order for Manaka to decide on who he loves and should date he goes to Oukusa for help. \r\nManaka decides and tells Satsuki something that would surprise her.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80759/358664.jpg"},{"title":"Civil War ?! / All Alone for Christmas","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"88511","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/80759/437728.jpg"},{"title":"Pursue My Dreams Again / Hold Me in the Snow","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"3067","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"248","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42873","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80759","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumb